<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-DIARY-Australia initial public offerings - March 10.</title>
<headline>RTRS-DIARY-Australia initial public offerings - March 10.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The companies listed have made application for admission to the official list of the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) and have been allocated a provisional ASX code. The ASX advises that allocation of a code does not imply that the company's application will be approved. Listing dates are expected listing dates but are subject to change.</p>
